# v2.0.0:
[list]
[*][b]Community Mod Menu (CMM):[/b] A shared in-game mod settings window with toggle, button, numeric, slider (double click to drag), dropdown, text (singleplayer-only), and list settings. Includes per-mod tabs, groups, search, global settings with host-only multiplayer editing, and Reset to Defaults.
[*][b]CMM Visual Editor:[/b] Browser-based tool for creating CMM settings without manual coding. Includes live preview and drag-and-drop ordering.
[*][b]is_host Trigger:[/b] Check if the current country is controlled by the host player.
[*][b]cmf_suppress Effect:[/b] Suppress "used but never set" and "set but never used" engine warnings with a single effect call.
[*][b]Player Country Hooks:[/b] Shared on_actions (cmf_yearly_human_country_pulse, cmf_monthly_human_country_pulse) that fire for each human player's country on yearly and monthly pulses.
[*][b]Community Mod Toolkit (CMT):[/b] Companion development tools — mod template, workshop uploader, and automated translation.
[*][b]Unified Callback System:[/b] Custom Alerts and Action Bar now use a single cmf_on_callback on_action.
[*][b]Scripted GUIs are no longer required:[/b] Alerts and action bar elements only need a Scripted GUI for conditional visibility or enabled state.
[*][b]Documentation:[/b] Full documentation on the [url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki]GitHub Wiki[/url] and quick reference on the [url=https://eu5.paradoxwikis.com/Community_Mod_Framework]Paradox Wiki[/url].
[/list]
